1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,767
India is the destination of the year for twenty twenty-seven. Know the ten things you must never do.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:09,222
Don't bring a vape. E-cigarettes are banned in India.

3
00:00:09,891 --> 00:00:13,076
Don't photograph airports, dams or military sites.

4
00:00:13,746 --> 00:00:15,728
Don't carry rupees in or out of the country.

5
00:00:16,398 --> 00:00:18,590
Don't eat beef. Several states ban it.

6
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:22,935
Don't carry a satellite phone or a handheld GPS without a licence.

7
00:00:23,606 --> 00:00:25,388
Don't keep your shoes on at a temple.

8
00:00:26,058 --> 00:00:29,370
Don't drink in public. It's illegal in parks and other public places.

9
00:00:30,041 --> 00:00:32,868
Don't show affection in public. It can draw negative attention.

10
00:00:33,538 --> 00:00:36,513
Don't buy ivory or wildlife products. It can mean prison.

11
00:00:37,183 --> 00:00:41,639
And don't go near North Sentinel Island. It's illegal within five nautical miles.

